[Music]  all right people it's finally time for  the Reuben report fan show round number  two our first fan show was shot back in  May of 2016 which basically seems like a  lifetime ago and we are beyond due for  another crack at it  if you miss it entirely we conducted  twenty interviews in one day with Reuben  report fans from all over the world  talking with viewers from the United  States in the United Kingdom to Egypt  and Jordan to Switzerland and Sweden  what mattered more than the diversity of  their geographic location or their color  or their religion was their diversity of  thought we had selected these twenty  fans out of over 1,400 submissions and I  promise you that we read every single  one of them  these fans wrote us incredibly  passionate essays about their life their  work in the countries that they live in  it was virtually impossible to pick the  final twenty and I can honestly say that  I loved every single interview that I  did that day it was an incredibly long  day for us and my brain was beyond fried  after but it was truly one of the most  rewarding and validating experiences of  my life so many people being willing to  stand up and be part of the battle of  ideas is everything I've tried to foster  here with this show to say it was a  humbling experience is beyond an  understatement  actually it was that fan show which  really sparked the idea of us taking the  show fully independent just this week  you may have seen this already we  crossed the hundred million view mark  and I can't think of a better way to  mark this milestone than talking to you  the fans directly this thing is really  taking off and it's you guys who are the  rocket fuel so for our second fan show  Rubin report calm slash fan show we'll  take you to a submission page tell us a  bit about yourself where you're from  your age why you watch the show and  anything else that you think is relevant  please though try to keep your  submissions under 10 sentences we really  loved reading the submissions last time  but we need to make sure that we have  the time to read them all be smart and  succinct and that'll be your best way of  getting through to us if you're one of  the 20 fans selected for an interview  you'll hear from the Rubin Report team  sometime in April if you submitted for  the last fan show but weren't selected  please  again so that we're sure to see your  submission and if you live in a place  where free speech isn't so free please  let us know how we can accommodate and  we'll see what we can do by the way if  you're a twenty five dollar and up  member on patreon you've got a golden  ticket opportunity to be on the show too  of the fan show selections will be  selected directly from this patreon pool  and we've got a separate forum for you  guys to fill out over at patreon.com  slash Reuben report you know so many of  you have told me that what we've done  here for the past two years has helped  create conversation in a time when  sharing ideas is becoming increasingly  rare this is your chance to say what you  think and be seen and heard by people  who feel the same way that you do you're  just one person but the ultimate  minority is the individual and an  individual with a good idea can change  the world go to Reuben report.com slash  fan show or click the link below and  hopefully I'll talk to you soon  [Music]  you

